                "text": "Instead of working together to bring down health care costs and increase transparency, the Biden admin\u2019s Association Health Plans (AHP) rule hurts workers and small businesses.\n\u00a0\nAHPs level the playing field for small businesses by allowing high-quality coverage at better rates.",
